cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the associated data, please cite it using
  the metadata below.
type: software
title: "TrustSECO-Next: Building trust in the open source software ecosystem"
authors:
  - name: "The TrustSECO contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/SecureSECO/TrustSECO-Next/graphs/contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SecureSECO/TrustSECO-Next"
url: "https://github.com/SecureSECO/TrustSECO-Next"
abstract: >-
  TrustSECO brings software measurements, community verification and signed
  ledger records together to make the evidence behind software trust open
  and visible. Its ambition is to help people make better-informed decisions
  about the open source software they depend on.
keywords:
  - software ecosystems
  - open source
  - software trust
  - community verification
